ontent": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn11le08ob05re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "Many modern singles admit to being bashful when it comes to meeting people of the opposite sex. They confess to having very little time in their busy schedules to meet someone new. With so many obstacles on the path to true love, few would object to using technology in order to help them find a mate. A company in Japan must have noticed this developing trend. That is why they have developed a new electronic device that helps single men and women meet.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "", "text": "This handy new love gadget must have been designed with utility in mind, as it is small enough to be carried around in your pocket or used as a key chain. The device contains a little computer and a radar sensor. For it to work, you simply punch in your likes and dislikes. If a potential match is in range, your love gadget picks up its signals. If this person has similar interests to the ones you've programmed in, both of your devices will begin to beep. Now all you have to do is find the person who is beeping and voila\u0301! The match is made!", "id": 2, "time": "23250"}, {"image": "", "text": "This new love gadget must have hit the mark on more than one occasion, as many satisfied customers have left testimonials on the company website. Isabella, an office assistant in a big robotics company, met her current boyfriend by using the mini matchmaker. \"I was quietly sitting in a cafe\u0301 with a couple of girlfriends when suddenly my gadget started beeping like crazy,\" said Isabella. \"I looked up and saw the most gorgeous guy sitting three feet away, holding up his love gadget and smiling at me! I couldn't believe it! My face must have turned beet red.\u201d Isabella says that without the love gadget she would never have approached this stranger. \"I would never just go up to a guy and start talking,\" Isabella said, \"but this way it seemed just right. I knew this guy liked the things I liked and that he was interested in meeting me.\" The couple's looking forward to getting married this June.", "id": 3, "time": "52000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Difficult Relationships", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A New App", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Exchange information about unlikely events or fairly certain conditions that will be fulfilled in the present, past or future  in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Perfect Modals: <span class=\"italic\">Must Have</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use perfect modals to talk about certainty or uncertainty about past events. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\">must have</span> + past participle to express the fact that you are 99% sure that something happened in the past. You are almost sure it happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Look at an example of how to use this Perfect modal:<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Jim was terribly sick yesterday. When I called him, he didn't pick up.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Heidi</span>: He <span class=\"strong\">must have fallen</span> asleep.</span>  <br/><br/> Here, Heidi is making a  <span class=\"underline\">logical conclusion</span> about the past. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A company in Japan must have noticed this developing trend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This handy new love gadget must have been designed with utility in mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This new love gadget must have hit the mark on more than one occasion, as many satisfied customers have left testimonials on the company website.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My face must have turned beet red.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Clauses Using <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>:  <span class=\"italic\">To</span> + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use the structure<span class=\"italic\"> to +  -ing</span> after certain verbs. In this case, <span class=\"italic\">to </span> acts as a preposition.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use these verbs with this structure:  <span class=\"italic\">adapt</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">confess</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">object</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">admit</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">adjust</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">look forward</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">own up</span>, and  <span class=\"italic\">resort</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "  <span class=\"italic\">He <span class=\"strong\">admitted to taking</span> the last cookie.<br/> I'm <span class=\"strong\">looking forward to seeing</span> you later.<br/> They <span class=\"strong\">confessed to stealing</span> the money.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These verbs can also be followed by   <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + noun phrase.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " For example:<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">They <span class=\"strong\">confessed to the crime</span>.<br/> I'm <span class=\"strong\">looking forward to the meeting</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Many modern singles admit to being bashful when it comes to meeting people of the opposite sex.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They confess to having very little time in their busy schedules to meet someone new.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "With so many obstacles on the path to true love, few would object to using technology in order to help them find a mate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The couple's looking forward to getting married this June.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bashful", "type": "name"}, {"content": "shy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Many modern singles admit to being bashful. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about technology and relationships.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "obstacle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thing that blocks one's way,  preventing or hindering progress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: With so many obstacles on the path to true love, few would object to using technology.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "romantic partner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Few would object to using technology in order to help them find a mate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gadget", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small mechanical device ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This handy new love gadget must have been designed with utility in mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "utility", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the state of being useful, profitable, or beneficial", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This handy new love gadget must have been designed with utility in mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "radar ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a system for detecting objects, speed or movement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The device contains a little computer and a radar sensor. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to beep", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make a short high-pitched sound ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Both of your devices will begin to beep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "matchmaker", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who introduces possible romantic partners ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Isabella, an office assistant in a big robotics company, met her current boyfriend by using the mini matchmaker. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "beet red ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extremely red", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My face must have turned beet red.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of an app that might make life easier.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Come up with a name for your app.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short description of your app, including how it works and who will use it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your idea to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I come up with ideas for a new app.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a description of what my app will do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a description of my target audience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my ideas with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}